ob=[r for r in wal if r['kind']=='OBSERVATION'];anchor=next(r for r in ob if (r['data'].get('lifecycleDiagnostics')or{}).get('counts',{}).get('started')==923 and abs((r['data'].get('mediaReadiness')or{}).get('frameAgeMs',-1)-samples[-1]['frameAgeMs'])<.001);later=next(r for r in ob if r['seq']>anchor['seq']and(r['data'].get('lifecycleDiagnostics')or{}).get('counts',{}).get('started',0)>=925)
assert later['hostMonoMs']-anchor['hostMonoMs']<1200
before=anchor['data'];after=later['data'];assert after['lifecycleDiagnostics']['counts']['acknowledged']>=925 and after['lifecycleDiagnostics']['counts']['failed']==after['lifecycleDiagnostics']['counts']['deadline']==0
assert after['hostLoopDiagnostics']['callbacks']>before['hostLoopDiagnostics']['callbacks']and after['hostLoopDiagnostics']['maxGapMs']<400
assert before['mediaReadiness']['active']and after['mediaReadiness']['active']and before['mediaReadiness']['previewReady']and after['mediaReadiness']['previewReady']
assert before['mediaReadiness']['clockSessionId']==after['mediaReadiness']['clockSessionId']==samples[-1]['clockSessionId']
late=json.loads(read('root-ground-stale-snapshot01.json'));v=late['observation'];o=v['observation'];s=late['state'];assert v['ageMs']<=1200 and o['seq']>695 and s['client']['active']and s['client']['ageMs']<3000 and s['flight']['run']is None and s['flight']['authority']is None and s['payloadLeaseObservation']['leaseCount']==0
assert all(o[k]==samples[-1]['binding'][k]for k in samples[-1]['binding']);assert o['mediaReadiness']['active']and o['mediaReadiness']['previewReady']and o['mediaReadiness']['clockStatus']=='CALIBRATED_BOUNDS'
emuguard=[json.loads(l)for l in read('android-guard04.jsonl').splitlines()];near=[r for r in emuguard if err['pythonMonoS']-5<=r['mono']<=err['pythonMonoS']+5];assert len(near)>=8;maxguardgap=max(b['mono']-a['mono']for a,b in zip(near,near[1:]));assert maxguardgap<1.3
assert not list((E/'flight/runs').iterdir())
report={'at':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'status':'PASS_INDEPENDENT_DIAGNOSIS_REFUSAL_RETAINED_CAUSE_UNRESOLVED','classification':'ACTUAL_PERSISTED_GROUND_EVIDENCE_READONLY','inputs':inputs,'finding':'A transient stale UI-observation upper bound was observed. A sustained host-loop or whole native/client/media stall is not supported by retained evidence. Exact initiating cause remains UNKNOWN.','failure':{'error':failure['error'],'acceptedSamples':len(samples),'lastAcceptedElapsedS':samples[-1]['elapsedPythonS'],'refusalElapsedFromControllerCommandS':elapsed,'note':'69.092s is the last accepted sample; refusal is approximately69.610s after the controller ground command. Frozen observation() discards the failing response on age>1200ms, so exact rejected age/sequence is not retained.','lastTwoSamples':samples[-2:]},'sameContextWAL':{'anchor':{'seq':anchor['seq'],'hostMonoMs':anchor['hostMonoMs'],'lifecycle':before['lifecycleDiagnostics'],'hostLoop':before['hostLoopDiagnostics'],'media':before['mediaReadiness']},'next':{'seq':later['seq'],'hostMonoMs':later['hostMonoMs'],'lifecycle':after['lifecycleDiagnostics'],'hostLoop':after['hostLoopDiagnostics'],'media':after['mediaReadiness']},'elapsedWithinNodeDomainMs':later['hostMonoMs']-anchor['hostMonoMs']},'falsification':[{'hypothesis':'Sustained host event-loop stall','disposition':'CONTRADICTED_FOR_RETAINED_NEARBY_POINTS','evidence':'Host callback count advances3327→3331 over1038.334ms; cumulative maximum callback gap322.118ms.'},{'hypothesis':'Sustained whole WebView/native foreground-client freeze','disposition':'NOT_SUPPORTED','evidence':'Reported lifecycle requests/ACKs advance923→925 with zero failures/deadlines in1038.334ms; frame age10.9→4.9ms under same viewer session. This does not exclude a short UI publication/request delay.'},{'hypothesis':'Persistent source stop or expired viewer clock','disposition':'NOT_SUPPORTED_FOR_RETAINED_POINTS','evidence':'Nearby and late observations remain active/previewReady/calibrated with same6013source binding. No source/viewer restaging is needed to explain recovery.'},{'hypothesis':'Observation publication/poll scheduling or request delay beyond1200ms age bound','disposition':'PLAUSIBLE_UNPROVEN','evidence':'UI seq695 was read twice while its age rose189.805→715.694ms; next call refused. UI publication interval is1000ms with asynchronous challenge/POST, leaving finite slack. Failing raw response/request timing was not retained, so client timer, request, host acceptance and polling cannot be uniquely attributed.'}], 'lateRecovery':{'classification':late.get('classification'),'at':late['at'],'observationAgeMs':v['ageMs'],'seq':o['seq'],'clientAgeMs':s['client']['ageMs'],'media':o['mediaReadiness'],'failureInstantEvidence':False},'emulatorSupervisor':{'nearbyRecords':len(near),'maxLoggingGapS':maxguardgap,'minimumFreeBytes':min(r['freeBytes']for r in near),'scope':'Python supervisor continued; not direct proof of guest rendering latency.'},'disposition':'Ground attempt remains REFUSED, no AP admitted. No relaxation or reuse of69s. Root-authorized one additional read-only75s interval must independently pass full current binding and two periodic renewals per role within original30minute window; any scenario left unrun remains NOT_CHECKED/NOT_READY.','limits':['QA performed no UI/API actions, runtime launches, helper edits, pin changes or retries.','Node host, viewer browser and Python monotonic timestamps are kept in separate domains; semantic counters bind nearby evidence without numerically merging clocks.','Periodic UI WAL omits unchanged-signature publications; it cannot reconstruct every observation request or prove the precise missing publication interval.']}
out=E/'qa-ground-stale-diagnosis01.json'
with out.open('x')as f:json.dump(report,f,indent=2);f.write('\n');f.flush();os.fsync(f.fileno())
